# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Nothing here is committed except this example.

# --- Gate ---
# The single passphrase that unlocks the app. Pick something long.
APP_PASSPHRASE=change-me

# --- Database ---
# Local development: a SQLite file (created on first run, gitignored). This is the default if unset.
DATABASE_URL=file:./data/yeschef.db
# Production (Turso): DATABASE_URL=libsql://<db-name>-<org>.turso.io plus the auth token.
# DATABASE_AUTH_TOKEN=

# --- Photos ---
# Production: a Vercel Blob read-write token (Vercel dashboard -> Storage -> Blob). When unset,
# photos are written to ./data/uploads and served by the app itself.
# BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN=

# --- Link import (AI) ---
# Pages without schema.org recipe data - and text you paste - are parsed by an LLM. Pick a provider
# by setting its key; LLM_PROVIDER=anthropic|gemini|none overrides the auto-detection, LLM_MODEL
# overrides the default model (claude-opus-5 for Anthropic, gemini-3.6-flash for Gemini).
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
# LLM_PROVIDER=anthropic
# LLM_MODEL=
#
# YouTube links (Shorts included) are read by a model that watches the video, audio and all. Only
# Gemini can do this, so GEMINI_API_KEY enables it whatever LLM_PROVIDER says; without the key the
# app falls back to the video's description. The model is chosen by the video's length -
# gemini-3.5-flash-lite up to 4 minutes, gemini-3.6-flash beyond - and LLM_VIDEO_MODEL pins one for
# every video. Free-tier daily allowances are per model and small (20/day on gemini-3.6-flash), so
# enable billing on the key if imports start coming back quota-limited.
# LLM_VIDEO_MODEL=
#
# Keyless alternative for Claude (Workload Identity Federation): no API key anywhere. Vercel signs a
# short-lived identity token per request and the SDK exchanges it for a short-lived Anthropic token.
# These four IDs are not secrets. Locally, `vercel link` / `vercel env pull` provide VERCEL_OIDC_TOKEN.
# An API key, if also set, takes precedence.
# ANTHROPIC_ORGANIZATION_ID=
# ANTHROPIC_FEDERATION_RULE_ID=fdrl_...
# ANTHROPIC_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_ID=svac_...
# ANTHROPIC_WORKSPACE_ID=wrkspc_...
# ANTHROPIC_OIDC_AUDIENCE=https://api.anthropic.com   # must equal the federation rule's audience
